      Head Diameter: 0.10000000149011612
      Head Length: 0.05000000074505806
      Length: 0.30000001192092896
      Line Style: Billboards
      Line Width: 0.10000000149011612
      Name: Global Path
      Offset:
        X: 0
        Y: 0
        Z: 0.05000000074505806
