      Focal Shape Size: 0.05000000074505806
      Invert Z Axis: false
      Name: Current View
      Near Clip Distance: 0.009999999776482582
      Pitch: 1.1697968244552612
      Target Frame: base_footprint
      Value: Orbit (rviz_default_plugins)
      Yaw: 3.027172327041626
    Saved: ~
